  "visualBrief": "Independent South Building: full mapped cruciform two-storey body, banded red brick and pale terracotta, canted central bays, green-gray mansard roofs with pedimented dormers, four end pavilions and paired tall chimneys, raised decorated drum and broad dark copper dome. Reconstruct a lower west service entrance recess/soffit and three approach treads; entrance bearing and thresholds are approximate. Preserve the independent planetarium, Altazimuth Pavilion and all other campus buildings. Exterior only: no furnished galleries, working instruments, copied inscriptions, sculpture portraits or signs.",
