  "scaleBasis": "No mapped height. Working wall7.8m/mansard10.7m, end pavilions12.4m/chimneys14m, upper core11.3m/drum14m/dome18.8m and simple finial20.3m are picture-led estimates. Banded facade/window/pilaster/dormer inventories, hidden roof junctions, end repetition and dome profile are simplified. Shared stone graph tinted terracotta substitutes for molded ornament; slate is tinted green-gray. The historic principal eastern entrance is at first-floor level; exact hillside access is unverified and the lower west door is a reconstructed service-entry proxy, not a surveyed principal entrance.",
